n it?":[15,19],"#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 1 Prep###What is \"retrospective diagnosis\" - and should historians engage in it?#{1}":[17,19],"#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 1 Prep###How helpful are the Wikipedia entry on the Black Death and the excerpt from _The Middle Ages: A Very Short Introduction_ for understanding the key questions about plague that historians are grappling with and why these questions matter?":[20,26],"#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 1 Prep###How helpful are the Wikipedia entry on the Black Death and the excerpt from _The Middle Ages: A Very Short Introduction_ for understanding the key questions about plague that historians are grappling with and why these questions matter?#{1}":[22,26]},"outlinks":[]},"smart_blocks:Historian's Toolkit - Semester 1/Historians Toolkit Tutorial 1 Prep.md#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 1 Prep": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[0.01363797,0.04073991,0.10637192,0.02262538,0.04859458,-0.04675819,0.00071566,0.0132017,0.00117492,-0.01505732,-0.03789674,-0.0871461,-0.02273595,0.07614665,-0.02778008,-0.00616477,-0.04949105,0.02582048,0.03630633,0.0045654,-0.0432888,0.01144559,0.05686641,-0.00462681,0.00451476,0.04949114,-0.01091491,-0.03900372,-0.02938413,-0.21756588,-0.02204313,-0.01830054,-0.04216753,0.02121865,-0.04018925,0.0349968,0.01166382,0.01888491,0.00129971,0.02193446,0.00189002,0.06820038,0.03578541,-0.02024496,-0.08240572,-0.05531544,0.00080657,-0.03054359,-0.06049844,-0.04303817,-0.03939193,-0.01537181,0.01555238,0.00480665,0.00783646,0.02313197,0.08106557,0.00554687,0.04113794,0.03626634,0.051276,0.01082492,-0.22220093,0.09256098,0.02984512,0.01315827,-0.04909238,0.01601371,0.00996188,0.02107189,-0.10688335,-0.01984072,0.00162708,0.02774524,-0.02431555,0.00705256,-0.03379026,0.00324675,0.00962997,-0.03571462,0.07574826,0.06789722,0.04823362,-0.03104383,0.02565072,-0.04569934,-0.00357944,-0.00902319,0.02904019,0.00848793,0.04607104,-0.05586236,0.04370726,-0.02627428,-0.00279952,0.06096753